- Number of renewable resource types: {NUM_RESOURCES}
- Number of execution modes per activity: {NUM_MODES}
- Resource capacities (renewable): {RESOURCE_CAPACITIES}
- Mode durations: {MODE_DURATIONS}
- Mode resource requirements: {MODE_RESOURCE_REQUIREMENTS}
- Mode costs: {MODE_COSTS}
- Project budget (cap on total mode costs): {BUDGET}
- Precedence relationships with minimum and maximum lags: {PRECEDENCE_EDGES_WITH_LAGS}
- Earliest start times (release dates): {RELEASE_DATES}
- Hard activity deadlines: {DEADLINES}
